(4929479, 716889, 62006, '<td valign="top">Front page material. Best of the bunch. The clarity and focus in this is wonderful. Very nice crop as well.</td>', 'Front page material. Best of the bunch. The clarity and focus in this is wonderful. Very nice crop as well.', '2008-09-03 01:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
