(4929876, 717737, 97936, '<td valign="top">I think this is really creative.  I love the angle on the soldier and the way he falls off the side of the frame.  I think with the solid background, the huge solid duck is a little overwhelming.  I would have liked to see the duck backed up a little to give the picture more depth, and I think it would have been really cool with either a more natural or a less distinct background.</td>', 'I think this is really creative.  I love the angle on the soldier and the way he falls off the side of the frame.  I think with the solid background, the huge solid duck is a little overwhelming.  I would have liked to see the duck backed up a little to give the picture more depth, and I think it would have been really cool with either a more natural or a less distinct background.', '2008-09-03 02:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4929903, 717699, 97936, '<td valign="top">I think this is very sleek and beautiful, but it''s just a little bit too much black space for me.  I would not change the shadows, but I would like to see the shot framed a little bit differently.</td>', 'I think this is very sleek and beautiful, but it''s just a little bit too much black space for me.  I would not change the shadows, but I would like to see the shot framed a little bit differently.', '2008-09-03 02:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
