(4930002, 716006, 97936, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the bold fashion against the subdued colors of the landscape.  I think the legs are very bright and that side gets washed a bit, though, while the doll''s face is still quite shaded.  The pose is very lifelike, which is cool, and the doll appears very thoughtful, but I''m not sure she''s aware she has such a nice view.  I''d like to see her shifted to be more engaged in her environment.</td>', 'I like the contrast of the bold fashion against the subdued colors of the landscape.  I think the legs are very bright and that side gets washed a bit, though, while the doll''s face is still quite shaded.  The pose is very lifelike, which is cool, and the doll appears very thoughtful, but I''m not sure she''s aware she has such a nice view.  I''d like to see her shifted to be more engaged in her environment.', '2008-09-03 02:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930005, 717607, 97225, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color arrangement.</td>', 'Nice composition and color arrangement.', '2008-09-03 02:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930009, 717364, 97225, '<td valign="top">I think that the lighting really works against this.</td>', 'I think that the lighting really works against this.', '2008-09-03 02:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930012, 717608, 97225, '<td valign="top">That is a good interpretation of this theme.</td>', 'That is a good interpretation of this theme.', '2008-09-03 02:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930015, 717715, 97225, '<td valign="top">Like it.</td>', 'Like it.', '2008-09-03 02:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
