(4930127, 717591, 97225, '<td valign="top">What a sweet little fella.</td>', 'What a sweet little fella.', '2008-09-03 03:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930128, 715732, 97936, '<td valign="top">I think you could be more extreme with the shadowing and make this a much more creative image.  The shapes and textures of this composition are very smooth and basic, so I think if you''re going to do this kind of contrast with the lighting, you should really commit to it.</td>', 'I think you could be more extreme with the shadowing and make this a much more creative image.  The shapes and textures of this composition are very smooth and basic, so I think if you''re going to do this kind of contrast with the lighting, you should really commit to it.', '2008-09-03 03:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930129, 717731, 97225, '<td valign="top">I''d sure like to know the story behind this.</td>', 'I''d sure like to know the story behind this.', '2008-09-03 03:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930134, 717318, 97225, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like him to come and scare my blackbirds next time our plums are ripening.</td>', 'I think I''d like him to come and scare my blackbirds next time our plums are ripening.', '2008-09-03 03:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930139, 717674, 97936, '<td valign="top">The doll is positioned very nicely, but I struggle with the very bold costume against the very bold background.  I''m almost more drawn to the background than the doll.  I think a less dramatic shade would compete less with the clown costume allowing the character to really stand out.</td>', 'The doll is positioned very nicely, but I struggle with the very bold costume against the very bold background.  I''m almost more drawn to the background than the doll.  I think a less dramatic shade would compete less with the clown costume allowing the character to really stand out.', '2008-09-03 03:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930140, 717292, 97225, '<td valign="top">Hmm.. save her if you can.</td>', 'Hmm.. save her if you can.', '2008-09-03 03:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930142, 717672, 97225, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful, delicate portrait of a gorgeous doll. I think this is my favorite.</td>', 'What a beautiful, delicate portrait of a gorgeous doll. I think this is my favorite.', '2008-09-03 03:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930147, 717619, 97936, '<td valign="top">How fun!  I love the depth of field and the soft contrasting background.  I love the action captured in the shot.  I wish the flower-holding puppet would have caught just a tad more light or been just a fraction higher in the frame and the left side didn''t get quite as dark, but this is such a happy fun shot!  I love it!</td>', 'How fun!  I love the depth of field and the soft contrasting background.  I love the action captured in the shot.  I wish the flower-holding puppet would have caught just a tad more light or been just a fraction higher in the frame and the left side didn''t get quite as dark, but this is such a happy fun shot!  I love it!', '2008-09-03 03:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930157, 714739, 97936, '<td valign="top">I like the way the main subject here is gesturing, as if he''s saying "It''s all about me!"  I''d like to see more light hitting the front of him, though, and I''d prefer not to see him cut off right at the knee.  I also feel that the image is a little unbalanced with the extra arm and empty ceiling on the left side.</td>', 'I like the way the main subject here is gesturing, as if he''s saying "It''s all about me!"  I''d like to see more light hitting the front of him, though, and I''d prefer not to see him cut off right at the knee.  I also feel that the image is a little unbalanced with the extra arm and empty ceiling on the left side.', '2008-09-03 03:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930168, 717590, 97936, '<td valign="top">I like your creative interpretation!  Kites are like puppets on strings!  I think I would have liked to see more of the standing subject''s shadow rather than the empty ground on the right.  I think you did the right thing here in making the horizon line so low so the ground texture would not overwhelm the kites in the empty sky.</td>', 'I like your creative interpretation!  Kites are like puppets on strings!  I think I would have liked to see more of the standing subject''s shadow rather than the empty ground on the right.  I think you did the right thing here in making the horizon line so low so the ground texture would not overwhelm the kites in the empty sky.', '2008-09-03 04:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930175, 717556, 97936, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful choice of subject, and the poses are great.  I think the idea of putting these puppets in a natural setting is very creative, but I think in this case the textures and colors distract from the main subjects.  I think this could have benefited from a simpler background or a shorter depth of field to keep focus on the puppets.</td>', 'This is a really beautiful choice of subject, and the poses are great.  I think the idea of putting these puppets in a natural setting is very creative, but I think in this case the textures and colors distract from the main subjects.  I think this could have benefited from a simpler background or a shorter depth of field to keep focus on the puppets.', '2008-09-03 04:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930179, 717344, 97936, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft background here coupled with the doll''s stiff expression.  The colors are great.  I wish there was a little bit less shadow on the doll''s face.</td>', 'I really like the soft background here coupled with the doll''s stiff expression.  The colors are great.  I wish there was a little bit less shadow on the doll''s face.', '2008-09-03 04:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930183, 717732, 97936, '<td valign="top">I love this shot!  I think the shallow depth of field is great with the softening rings, but I wish on the whole doll the near eye were as sharp as the far one.</td>', 'I love this shot!  I think the shallow depth of field is great with the softening rings, but I wish on the whole doll the near eye were as sharp as the far one.', '2008-09-03 04:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930188, 717732, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad to see a Russian doll in the challenge, I was hoping I would. Really nice shot and DOF.</td>', 'I''m so glad to see a Russian doll in the challenge, I was hoping I would. Really nice shot and DOF.', '2008-09-03 04:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930190, 717267, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like the use of a magnifying glass here instead of just a macro on him.</td>', 'I like the use of a magnifying glass here instead of just a macro on him.', '2008-09-03 04:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930191, 716631, 97936, '<td valign="top">I think you could have made the shadow an even bigger part of this shot.  The shape is very interesting!</td>', 'I think you could have made the shadow an even bigger part of this shot.  The shape is very interesting!', '2008-09-03 04:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
