(4930228, 717454, 97936, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve done this shot from above rather than the standard 3/4 portrait view.  I think that even with the shallow depth of field, the lace trim is still a little bit distracting, as the focal point seems to be the eyes.  I think you could probably go even  more shallow, or maybe shift the doll or just turn her head to put a her dress a little more into the shadow.</td>', 'I like that you''ve done this shot from above rather than the standard 3/4 portrait view.  I think that even with the shallow depth of field, the lace trim is still a little bit distracting, as the focal point seems to be the eyes.  I think you could probably go even  more shallow, or maybe shift the doll or just turn her head to put a her dress a little more into the shadow.', '2008-09-03 04:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930230, 717731, 94265, '<td valign="top">Gosh this one is filled with emotion, I can imagine several different stories here and all of them tragic. Very moving, well done.</td>', 'Gosh this one is filled with emotion, I can imagine several different stories here and all of them tragic. Very moving, well done.', '2008-09-03 04:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4930235, 717272, 97936, '<td valign="top">Your subject is very cute, but I think there are too few bears showing to really make it an interesting picture.  Also, I think it would be better if the dog were not centered in the photo.</td>', 'Your subject is very cute, but I think there are too few bears showing to really make it an interesting picture.  Also, I think it would be better if the dog were not centered in the photo.', '2008-09-03 04:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
