(4930243, 717340, 97936, '<td valign="top">For this kind of an image, I would like to see the entire characters, including feet.  I think it would be more interesting if the dolls were placed in a context rather than posed against a solid background.  That said, I like the pairing, the image is very crisp, and the pose is quite nice.</td>', 'For this kind of an image, I would like to see the entire characters, including feet.  I think it would be more interesting if the dolls were placed in a context rather than posed against a solid background.  That said, I like the pairing, the image is very crisp, and the pose is quite nice.', '2008-09-03 04:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
