(4931637, 717428, 33769, '<td valign="top">very adorable  tho my eyes keep jumping all over the place... not really finding a single point of interest - but instead jumping from multiple points of interest...lights in the background...the orange tiger/the brownish bear/cat the shapes created by the white...then to the tag and back to the lights again.... -- i like how they''re back to back; it makes me think of my trip to the carnival a few weeks ago</td>', 'very adorable  tho my eyes keep jumping all over the place... not really finding a single point of interest - but instead jumping from multiple points of interest...lights in the background...the orange tiger/the brownish bear/cat the shapes created by the white...then to the tag and back to the lights again.... -- i like how they''re back to back; it makes me think of my trip to the carnival a few weeks ago', '2008-09-03 15:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4931644, 716631, 33769, '<td valign="top">I''m finding my eyes are more interested in the shadow than the doll- I''m not sure if that is what you intended but its an amazing shadow; really interesting -  (I don''t deduct points for this= but just so you know that you have some dust-spots on your lens (left of the frame; and somewhat towards the center) -- its a lovely doll I''d like to see it cropped differently tho to pull my interest into the doll and the shadow created by the doll...</td>', 'I''m finding my eyes are more interested in the shadow than the doll- I''m not sure if that is what you intended but its an amazing shadow; really interesting -  (I don''t deduct points for this= but just so you know that you have some dust-spots on your lens (left of the frame; and somewhat towards the center) -- its a lovely doll I''d like to see it cropped differently tho to pull my interest into the doll and the shadow created by the doll...', '2008-09-03 15:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4931649, 717723, 33769, '<td valign="top">very cute;  something feels off about some of the colors.... I can''t quite put my finger on it; perhaps its the pink at war with all the rest of the colors? I think I would have liked this better if it was done as a portrait; tho it is still nice my interest level would be higher seeing the face/upper torso (perhaps because there is nothing going on with the legs/arms I don''t quite feel like I need to see them..? ) just throwing some thoughts out there and first reactions - hope its helpful..</td>', 'very cute;  something feels off about some of the colors.... I can''t quite put my finger on it; perhaps its the pink at war with all the rest of the colors? I think I would have liked this better if it was done as a portrait; tho it is still nice my interest level would be higher seeing the face/upper torso (perhaps because there is nothing going on with the legs/arms I don''t quite feel like I need to see them..? ) just throwing some thoughts out there and first reactions - hope its helpful..', '2008-09-03 15:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
