(4932824, 715496, 97936, '<td valign="top">This is certainly dramatic!  I''m not sure how her foot could have gotten all the way to the front of the frame by itself, though.  I would have liked a little more realism in the pose if possible, or maybe a hint of a murder weapon.  I could also see this being really creepy in black and white!</td>', 'This is certainly dramatic!  I''m not sure how her foot could have gotten all the way to the front of the frame by itself, though.  I would have liked a little more realism in the pose if possible, or maybe a hint of a murder weapon.  I could also see this being really creepy in black and white!', '2008-09-03 22:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932831, 717734, 97936, '<td valign="top">I like how this image works with the blue doll''s expression.  It''s very clever.  I would like it better with more of a context than the plain white background provides.</td>', 'I like how this image works with the blue doll''s expression.  It''s very clever.  I would like it better with more of a context than the plain white background provides.', '2008-09-03 22:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
