(4934642, 717608, 47470, '<td valign="top">I get what those black lines are supposed to be, but since you used a real hand instead of a fake one, I think the photo might have worked better if you had played that up to make some kind of statement about people being puppets of the government or consumerism or whatever : )  It might also look a bit cleaner if you couldn''t see the knots and the extra hanging bits of string.  I love the concept though!</td>', 'I get what those black lines are supposed to be, but since you used a real hand instead of a fake one, I think the photo might have worked better if you had played that up to make some kind of statement about people being puppets of the government or consumerism or whatever : )  It might also look a bit cleaner if you couldn''t see the knots and the extra hanging bits of string.  I love the concept though!', '2008-09-04 17:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
