(4934665, 717355, 47470, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, reflection, composition, and depth of field.  If I could be the slightest bit nit-picky, I''d say to take out the white bit on the left side rim and the little marks on the plate, but neither of those can be done with these rule.  Wonderful image.  My bet for the front page.</td>', 'Great lighting, reflection, composition, and depth of field.  If I could be the slightest bit nit-picky, I''d say to take out the white bit on the left side rim and the little marks on the plate, but neither of those can be done with these rule.  Wonderful image.  My bet for the front page.', '2008-09-04 17:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4934668, 717537, 47470, '<td valign="top">I like the scary lighting; it goes well with his huge eyes.  Maybe a slight tilt would give some movement and make it seem like he was zombie-walking towards the viewer.</td>', 'I like the scary lighting; it goes well with his huge eyes.  Maybe a slight tilt would give some movement and make it seem like he was zombie-walking towards the viewer.', '2008-09-04 17:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
