(4934735, 717272, 47470, '<td valign="top">This might have worked a bit better if you had more dolls in the picture for the dog to hide amongst.</td>', 'This might have worked a bit better if you had more dolls in the picture for the dog to hide amongst.', '2008-09-04 18:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
