(4934761, 717499, 95884, '<td valign="top">I believe that some sharper post processing would make this a wonderful photo.  I love this doll</td>', 'I believe that some sharper post processing would make this a wonderful photo.  I love this doll', '2008-09-04 18:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
