(4934811, 717731, 86848, '<td valign="top">Wow, instant sadness hit me before I read the title.  I like the bokeh in the background, nice sharp image.   Great job!</td>', 'Wow, instant sadness hit me before I read the title.  I like the bokeh in the background, nice sharp image.   Great job!', '2008-09-04 18:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
