(4944455, 717292, 83313, '<td valign="top">Creative interpretation and artistically done, but...<br/> <br/>Post-challenge edit:<br/>Hmmm. In spite of the title, I felt it was shoehorned and I did not fully get the connection with dolls until I read the comment by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=33769" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Love6</a>. That''s what happens when I speed-vote, while attempting to do a decent amount of commenting at the same time. I take back my previous "but..." and exchange it for an "attaboy".<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-10 00:32:17.</i></td>', 'Creative interpretation and artistically done, but... Post-challenge edit:Hmmm. In spite of the title, I felt it was shoehorned and I did not fully get the connection with dolls until I read the comment by  Love6. That''s what happens when I speed-vote, while attempting to do a decent amount of commenting at the same time. I take back my previous "but..." and exchange it for an "attaboy".', '2008-09-09 13:59:20.000000', '2008-09-10 01:32:17.000000', 1),
(4944462, 717556, 83313, '<td valign="top">Don''t trust that scoundrel, M''Lady!!</td>', 'Don''t trust that scoundrel, M''Lady!!', '2008-09-09 14:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944475, 716415, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but the execution is a little short, I''m afraid. Seems really fuzzy and blown out. Lacking in detail. I can''t tell if it''s because of your original shot, or if you over enhanced it. I wouldn''t mind seeing the out of the camera shot after the challenge.</td>', 'I like the concept but the execution is a little short, I''m afraid. Seems really fuzzy and blown out. Lacking in detail. I can''t tell if it''s because of your original shot, or if you over enhanced it. I wouldn''t mind seeing the out of the camera shot after the challenge.', '2008-09-09 14:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944487, 715566, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this entry has a lot of problems. The two major ones are:<br/>a) Colors are very washed out looking. I copied and pasted this into PaintShop Pro out of curiosity, and a quick levels adjustment improved that problem in a big way.<br/> <br/>b) Focus is on the grating and not on the doll. Refocusing, or using a narrower aperture to gain greater Depth Of Field would have helped there. There is nothing that can help that after the fact, however.</td>', 'I''m afraid this entry has a lot of problems. The two major ones are:a) Colors are very washed out looking. I copied and pasted this into PaintShop Pro out of curiosity, and a quick levels adjustment improved that problem in a big way. b) Focus is on the grating and not on the doll. Refocusing, or using a narrower aperture to gain greater Depth Of Field would have helped there. There is nothing that can help that after the fact, however.', '2008-09-09 14:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944489, 714931, 83313, '<td valign="top">Some may not consider porcelain figurines to be dolls, however, I''m being flexible on my definition for this challenge. A good enough shot, but it''s just not grabbing my attention in any way.</td>', 'Some may not consider porcelain figurines to be dolls, however, I''m being flexible on my definition for this challenge. A good enough shot, but it''s just not grabbing my attention in any way.', '2008-09-09 14:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944491, 715187, 83313, '<td valign="top">You found Mr. Bun-Buns!</td>', 'You found Mr. Bun-Buns!', '2008-09-09 14:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944492, 716606, 83313, '<td valign="top">Is he doing with that tree what I think he is? Maybe he''s just hugging his mother. Yea, that''s it...</td>', 'Is he doing with that tree what I think he is? Maybe he''s just hugging his mother. Yea, that''s it...', '2008-09-09 14:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944494, 717594, 83313, '<td valign="top">Other than the white balance being way off (Too yellowy. Try using the incandescent or fluorescent setting under these conditions), this is a nice clear close up of this action figure. Good composition and use of the shallow DOF, it leads my eye right to an interesting subject.</td>', 'Other than the white balance being way off (Too yellowy. Try using the incandescent or fluorescent setting under these conditions), this is a nice clear close up of this action figure. Good composition and use of the shallow DOF, it leads my eye right to an interesting subject.', '2008-09-09 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944495, 716715, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit of high ISO noise on Barb and her cleavage. Just a little noise reduction could smooth that out. I think the composition is a bit off, the one in focus seems squeezed too far over in the frame.</td>', 'A bit of high ISO noise on Barb and her cleavage. Just a little noise reduction could smooth that out. I think the composition is a bit off, the one in focus seems squeezed too far over in the frame.', '2008-09-09 14:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
