(4944754, 716889, 61315, '<td valign="top">Bumping this to 8 - I like the composition, lighting and DOF, and of course the tears - I hope this does well for you!</td>', 'Bumping this to 8 - I like the composition, lighting and DOF, and of course the tears - I hope this does well for you!', '2008-09-09 16:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944769, 717091, 61315, '<td valign="top">I love Kachina dolls, and have about a dozen myself, but I''m not sure others here at DPC are familiar with them so this may not score as highly as it should. I like your composition, processing, and even the strong lighting. This looks like a picture that might fit in to my Native American decor! :-)Good luck - I hope this does well for you! Bumping to 8</td>', 'I love Kachina dolls, and have about a dozen myself, but I''m not sure others here at DPC are familiar with them so this may not score as highly as it should. I like your composition, processing, and even the strong lighting. This looks like a picture that might fit in to my Native American decor! :-)Good luck - I hope this does well for you! Bumping to 8', '2008-09-09 16:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944772, 717515, 61315, '<td valign="top">What a cute trio - they look almost real! A little bit of BH here and there but not enough to matter to me. Bumping to 8</td>', 'What a cute trio - they look almost real! A little bit of BH here and there but not enough to matter to me. Bumping to 8', '2008-09-09 16:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944783, 717334, 61315, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but this reminds me of "Legally Blonde" - I like it! Nice composition, lighting and even the border works for this. I guess that''s a flower on the left but if it weren''t for the title, I might not have know so my only nit is that I wish I could see the flower better. Very cute - 7 from me</td>', 'I don''t know why but this reminds me of "Legally Blonde" - I like it! Nice composition, lighting and even the border works for this. I guess that''s a flower on the left but if it weren''t for the title, I might not have know so my only nit is that I wish I could see the flower better. Very cute - 7 from me', '2008-09-09 16:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4944787, 715549, 61315, '<td valign="top">Pretty creepy but an interesting take on the topic! I think I''d like a sharper focus, but the comp and lighting are good to create a scary atmosphere.</td>', 'Pretty creepy but an interesting take on the topic! I think I''d like a sharper focus, but the comp and lighting are good to create a scary atmosphere.', '2008-09-09 16:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
