(4947102, 717318, 97907, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the comments. However, like my description said, I composed the shot of my puppet this way.  If you would have done it another way, then build you own puppet and shoot it your way. You don''t think I did all that? I know the consequences of shooting midday,and I had flashes with me. I entered a challenge, not a "critique the crap out of ones work" contest. Again, thanks to those who actually liked it the way it was, and saw it the way I did.</td>', 'Thank you for all the comments. However, like my description said, I composed the shot of my puppet this way.  If you would have done it another way, then build you own puppet and shoot it your way. You don''t think I did all that? I know the consequences of shooting midday,and I had flashes with me. I entered a challenge, not a "critique the crap out of ones work" contest. Again, thanks to those who actually liked it the way it was, and saw it the way I did.', '2008-09-10 11:22:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4947108, 717734, 27373, '<td valign="top">This is a surprising finish.  Not because it isn''t a good photo.  Lighting is excellent, focus is spot on (I actually prefer this one to the remake), tells a funny story.  I didn''t vote on this challenge- I probably would''ve given you a 7 or 8 on this shot- when I paged through the entries I thought for sure you''d get killed by the "anything remotely suggesting sex is a 1" crowd, and the "if its not serious it sux" crowd.  Congrats.  There may be hope for DPC yet.  :)</td>', 'This is a surprising finish.  Not because it isn''t a good photo.  Lighting is excellent, focus is spot on (I actually prefer this one to the remake), tells a funny story.  I didn''t vote on this challenge- I probably would''ve given you a 7 or 8 on this shot- when I paged through the entries I thought for sure you''d get killed by the "anything remotely suggesting sex is a 1" crowd, and the "if its not serious it sux" crowd.  Congrats.  There may be hope for DPC yet.  :)', '2008-09-10 11:29:50.000000', NULL, 0),
