(4976537, 716354, 65858, '<td valign="top">=)  I grew up on this movie too.<br/> <br/>What kind of magic spell to use...<br/>Slime and snails,<br/>Puppy dog tails,<br/>Thunder or lightning... and baby says,<br/>Dance magic dance!<br/> <br/>Ok, that''s enough geeking out from me.<br/></td>', '=)  I grew up on this movie too. What kind of magic spell to use...Slime and snails,Puppy dog tails,Thunder or lightning... and baby says,Dance magic dance! Ok, that''s enough geeking out from me.', '2008-09-26 10:40:17.000000', NULL, 0),
