(5509647, 715549, 96534, '<td valign="top">lol, you''re a sick man. Actually you should know about a chucky story from here.....you may even have heard about it. In Tasmania, where i originally came from, there was a guy who was a bit of a recluse, had a rough time at home and school, and was addicted to chucky. One day he watched several episodes of it, then packed his old yellow volvo up with his surfboard on the top, and a machine gun in the back seat. He drove down to a place called Port Arthur, which is the historic ruins of one of the first penal settlements in Tasmania. He walked into the tourist filled restaurant with his gun, and said "don''t f^&amp;* with the Chucky", then mowed down anyone who didn''t manage to duck and cover in time. He then went out to a couple of tourist buses and blasted anyone he could find with his gun, still saying the same thing. He managed to kill 35 people in a short space of time, before finally being captured. <br/>I don''t think I''ll ever look at that doll in the same way again, so will now apologise for giving you a rather reactive 5 on that challenge, lol. You did a great job of recreating a very scary image, well done - even though i hate it, lol :-)</td>', 'lol, you''re a sick man. Actually you should know about a chucky story from here.....you may even have heard about it. In Tasmania, where i originally came from, there was a guy who was a bit of a recluse, had a rough time at home and school, and was addicted to chucky. One day he watched several episodes of it, then packed his old yellow volvo up with his surfboard on the top, and a machine gun in the back seat. He drove down to a place called Port Arthur, which is the historic ruins of one of the first penal settlements in Tasmania. He walked into the tourist filled restaurant with his gun, and said "don''t f^&* with the Chucky", then mowed down anyone who didn''t manage to duck and cover in time. He then went out to a couple of tourist buses and blasted anyone he could find with his gun, still saying the same thing. He managed to kill 35 people in a short space of time, before finally being captured. I don''t think I''ll ever look at that doll in the same way again, so will now apologise for giving you a rather reactive 5 on that challenge, lol. You did a great job of recreating a very scary image, well done - even though i hate it, lol :-)', '2009-06-02 06:56:51.000000', NULL, 0),
